Greetings Foodballers! 
We have updated our demo version!

Technical changes:

 A bot that has turned over on his side is automatically raised after 5-10 seconds;

Graphical changes:
MENU

 Select player effect;

MATCH

 Graphic effects for all characters' power-ups;
 Car collision effect;
 New effect of tomato explosion;
 New smoke at the gates;
 Graphic effects of winning the match;
 Result screen with a clearly marked winning team;
 The text about winning is more visible;



Quality of Life changes

 "Controls scheme" in the Pause menu;
 "Select map" view is more understandable;
 Possibility of speed up and slow down with keyboard arrows in “World-oriented controls”;


Sounds and music:

 Sounds for all characters' power-ups;
 Sound for Player's route in the Tournament mode;
 Starting engine sound at the beginning of the match;
 Engine sounds during the match;
 Car collision sounds fixed;
 Sound for car jump;
 Tomatoes hitting sound that scales with the speed at which it collided;
 Sound for rainy and windy weather;
 UI sound to change skin action at “Select hero” view;
 Sound at the end of the "Replay";
 Adjusted playback volume of all special effects during the "Replay";
 The hover and music on the menu is quieter.


Fixes
Correct display of results;

Greetings Foodballers! 
We have updated our demo version!

Multiplayer changes:

 Gamepad is now supported for all players on PC - Fixed issue with Player One not being able to Start Match with gamepad vs AI and Player Two, Three and Four gamepads
 Remote Play Together is on - you can also play together remotely;


Technical changes:


 Key captions in the menu according to the PC/Gamepad;
 Added “Audio settings”;
 The wheels of the car no longer collide with our invisible borders - it’s impossible to drive along the walls;
 Frozen characters cannot use their skills.
 The wheels of the car no longer collide with our invisible borders and now it’s impossible to drive along the walls;
 Bots are more intelligent -- improved their steering and how bots use their skills;
 Physics improvements to make each car ride different;




Graphical changes:
MENU

New sky in the “Main Menu”;
 “Result” view with a clearly marked winning team;
 Flashing arrows in the “Select team” view - now P1 does not look like an interactive control element;
 Good quality character icons now.

MATCH

 New graphic effects for Tanvi (Indian Foodtruck) skill;
 Upgraded graphical effects for other Foodtrucks
 New Intro for 1vs1 game;
 Better outlines in a game;
